   "contentDescription": "A man in First Class sits by the window eating, with a drink on the table."
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Lufthansa Allegris & FOX: The New Long-Haul Flight Experience",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 2 min read | Interview: Christoph Eisenschink</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>With FOX – Future Onboard Experience, Lufthansa is taking the long-haul travel experience to the next level. Yana Holzmann explains what guests can look forward to.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>What is FOX all about?</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "FOX stands for Future Onboard Experience. It’s about enhancing the entire long-haul travel experience across all travel classes – from dining and service to new tableware and brand partnerships.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/lufthansa-allegris-and-fox/lh_app_fox_lufthansa_first-class_service_16x9.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "A flight attendant hands a menu to a First Class passenger."
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Lufthansa has just introduced the new Allegris cabin. Is FOX the next logical step?</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Absolutely. With Allegris, we built the stage. With FOX, we’re bringing the performance to life.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "textLink_v2",
   "text": "More about Allegris",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
